msgstr "https://github.com/DiluxOne/diluxone-offload-wordpress"

#. Description of the plugin
#: diluxone-offload.php
msgid ""
"Move your WordPress media to cloud object storage and serve it from there. "
"Replaces /uploads/ transparently via a PHP stream wrapper."
msgstr ""
"Mueve tus archivos multimedia de WordPress a un almacenamiento de objetos en"
" la nube y sírvelos desde ahí. Reemplaza /uploads/ de forma transparente "
"mediante un stream wrapper de PHP."

